 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Ask at the local high school or community college. People there still remember their moms, and they know the best lunches. Another trick is asking at health clubs. People who work long hours and don't eat with family often make it up at the gym. Then support your local food scene. Pop in every few months, and every time say you' new in town. You' end up as their favorite tourist. Then stop at somewhere that feels like home. A cozy pub with warm cakes and a reliable dinner is perfect.",
